**Convention 8.4 (outcome and cut discipline).** An absent literal address is
an actual legal Read reply. Stop carries the full terminal output and is not a
Read failure; the native trace's Event type has no Stop constructor. A finite
evaluator miss is local computation, not an executed external reject. An illegal
unexecuted operation has no event/successor and is represented by `none`.
An executed numerical reject is `some(reject,successor)`: the source is unchanged
but its request ordinal and actual row history advance. Busy cuts admit only
their prescribed next primitive transition. Whole-call claims are at idle macro
cuts; a proposed every-cut bridge must retain phase, pending response, cursor,
token and partial-delivery fields as well.

**Open problem 8.5 (full programme beyond this frontier).** Construct substantive
natural spatial support, ordered executed events, continuation boundary and
callable-memory expressions on a declared actual dynamic observer. Prove for
each its exact task kernel, both inclusions, with complete outcomes, original
successors, record append and lawful selector transports on the joint reachable
image. A paid literal acquisition/journal adapter would remove the source-port
and causal-record gap; it would not by itself prove these four kernel equalities,
arbitrary-entry authentication, an unbounded-capacity realization or an infinite
actual thread. The finite lower bounds here leave all those bridges open and
preserve the original stationary programme.

